  "criterion": "Admit Target119 u20456 only when its complete normalized token stream is the complete Target118 ModeIndicator plus the one authenticated foreground-agents branch, all 69 owner rows and 15 scanner-added rows are pinned, the exact historical source delta owns the branch and its dependencies, and whole-unit replay remains blocked by the stale shortcut/chord dependency graph.",
